1. Instead of trying to import the actual I18nProvider, I created a mock version since we don't have access to the actual implementation
2. Added a mock I18n configuration
3. Wrapped the OtherTeamsListing component with the I18nProvider
4. Cleaned up the mock implementation to avoid runtime errors
5. Removed the direct manipulation of trpc and useLocale as that could cause issues
6. Simplified the mock data creation

This should resolve the import error while still maintaining the functionality of the preview component. The mock I18nProvider will pass through the children while providing the necessary context for internationalization.

